    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/335316q.png\" style=\"width: 271px; height: 65px;\" /><br /><br />According to circuit diagram, capacitors are connected in series combination.<br /><br />So, equivalent capacitance <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math><br /><br />We know that,<br /><br />Total electrostatic energy <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mn>C</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>9&nbsp;</mn><mi>μ</mi><mn>J</mn></math>",
